==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
{{prefix|en|para|typhoid fever}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|pathology}} Any of a variety of acute infectious intestinal diseases resembling [[typhoid fever]] but less severe, caused by eating food contaminated with certain [[bacteria]] of the genus ''[[Salmonella]]''.

